The vibrating square is somewhere on the lowest level of Gehennom.  Yes, you
may have to walk over a lot of ground to find it.  Once you get there, you
will need the Bell, the Book, the Candleabrum, and enough (seven) candles.
Vlad the Impaler has the Candleabrum.  To get to Vlad's tower, look for the
level in Gehennom that has two up staircases.  (Much like the dungeon level
way up in levels 2-5 that has two down with one of them to the mines...)
I think Vlad's tower is on a level above the Wiz's tower, but below all the 
Demon special levels.  (i.e. somewhere in the middle of Gehennom)  Vlad's 
tower also _always_ has an Amulet of Life Saving hidden in it somewhere.

The reason I think you're in deep s**t is because you have a lot of very time
consuming searching ahead of you and you've already got the Wizard after you.
He gets tougher every time you kill him, and I don't know of any way to get
rid of him permanently...  By the time you reach the endgame, he will be very
nasty indeed... that is, if you live long enough to get to the endgame.

